  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparaing young leaders for local level elections</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Outcomes
1)	Young leaders will have upheld democratic values and principles at local and central levels. 
2)	Young leaders will have influence on decision-making. 
3)	Young leaders will be capable of influencing discussions and solutions on contemporary socio-economic-political challenges. 
4)	Young female Leaders will have upheld democratic values and principles will have influence on decision making on contemporary socio-economic-political issues.</narrative>
  </description>
